{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|en|osteo|arthritis}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|osteoarthritides|+}}

# {{senseid|en|Q62736}} {{lb|en|medicine}} A form of [[arthritis]], affecting mainly older people, caused by chronic [[degeneration]] of the [[cartilage]] and [[synovial membrane]] of the joints, leading to [[pain]] and [[stiffness]].
#: {{syn|en|degenerative arthritis<id:Q62736>|degenerative joint disease<id:Q62736>|DJD<id:Q62736>}}

